{
  "slug": "onecli",
  "name": "Onecli",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect AI agents to external APIs with zero credential management. The OneCLI gateway transparently proxies all HTTPS traffic and injects stored credentials (OAuth tokens, API keys, AWS signatures) into outbound requests. Supports 40+ services including GitHub, Gmail, Google Calendar, Jira, AWS, Stripe, Datadog, and more. Policy rules enforce block, rate limit, and manual approval at the gateway level.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `gateway` (OneCLI Gateway: transparent HTTPS proxy that injects stored credentials into outbound calls), `providers` (Reference of all services supported by OneCLI gateway with their endpoints, auth patterns, and connection methods)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install onecli@claude-community` from `onecli/onecli-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 2
  },
